title: Project Structure
description: Detailed file and directory organization across all Lament ecosystem repositories.
section: Development
order: 1
---

## Overview

The Lament ecosystem consists of standalone, decoupled repositories. Each service maintains its own package dependencies, build scripts, and configuration files.

---

## 1. Web Client (`lament`)

```
lament/
├── src/
│   ├── app.html                # HTML shell template
│   ├── app.d.ts                # App-level TypeScript declarations
│   ├── hooks.server.ts         # Server hooks (auth validation, error handling)
│   ├── lib/
│   │   ├── api.ts              # Client-side fetch helper and endpoint methods
│   │   ├── server/
│   │   │   ├── api.ts          # Server-side API client module
│   │   │   └── proxy.ts        # Request forwarding and header injection
│   │   └── components/         # Svelte UI component library
│   │       ├── ui/             # Base UI primitives (button, dialog, input)
│   │       ├── player/         # Audio player control bar and lyrics viewer
│   │       └── layout/         # Navigation sidebar and page headers
│   └── routes/
│       ├── +layout.svelte      # Main application layout container
│       ├── +page.svelte        # Home dashboard page
│       ├── api/                # Server-side proxy endpoints (+server.ts)
│       ├── artists/            # Artist list and detail pages
│       ├── albums/             # Album catalog and detail pages
│       └── tracks/             # Track listing and detail pages
├── static/                     # Static branding assets and web manifest
├── svelte.config.js            # Svelte compiler configuration
├── vite.config.ts              # Vite bundle configuration
├── tailwind.config.js          # Tailwind CSS v4 setup
└── package.json                # Dependencies and dev scripts
```

---

## 2. Edge API Backend (`lament-api`)

```
lament-api/
├── src/
│   ├── index.ts                # Node/Bun development server entry point
│   ├── index-edge.ts           # Cloudflare Workers edge entry point
│   ├── server.ts               # Local dev server initialization
│   ├── routes/
│   │   ├── index.ts            # Main Hono app routing export
│   │   └── edge-routes.ts      # Endpoint mounting and route handlers
│   ├── controllers/            # Business logic handlers
│   │   ├── track.controller.ts # Track CRUD and random selection
│   │   ├── artist.controller.ts# Artist queries and discography
│   │   ├── album.controller.ts # Album tracklists
│   │   ├── lyrics.controller.ts# LRC parsing and variant serving
│   │   ├── stream.controller.ts# HLS playlist delivery and streaming
│   │   └── client.controller.ts# API key administration
│   ├── middlewares/
│   │   ├── auth.middleware.ts  # x-api-key and X-Master-Key validation
│   │   └── cache.middleware.ts # ETag and cache control headers
│   ├── services/
│   │   ├── cache.service.ts    # In-memory LRU cache manager
│   │   └── lyric-parser.service.ts # LRC timestamp parser
│   ├── config/
│   │   └── db.ts               # LibSQL client factory
│   └── utils/
│       └── crypto.ts           # SHA-256 and key hash utilities
├── schema.sql                  # LibSQL table definitions
├── wrangler.jsonc              # Cloudflare Workers deployment config
└── package.json                # Dependencies and dev scripts
```

---

## 3. Ingestion Pipeline (`lament-scrapper`)

```
lament-scrapper/
├── src/
│   ├── index.ts                # Main CLI entry point
│   ├── spotify.ts              # Spotify API metadata query client
│   ├── downloader.ts           # yt-dlp audio stream extractor
│   ├── lyrics.ts               # Genius and LRC lyrics client
│   ├── lastfm.ts               # Last.fm artist image scraper
│   ├── cloud.ts                # Cloudflare R2 S3 storage client
│   ├── db.ts                   # Database connection and queries
│   └── services/
│       ├── image.service.ts    # sharp WebP image resizing
│       └── hls.service.ts      # FFmpeg HLS chunking service
├── schema.sql                  # Local database schema copy
└── package.json                # Dependencies and dev scripts
```
